ORGFILTR TITLE 'CUCCA VM NETWORK MAILER VERSION 1 - FILTER FILES FROM  *
               LOCAL USERS'
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*      MAILER -- Copyright (c) 1982,1985 Columbia University.         *
*    Program Property of the Trustees of Columbia University in the   *
*    City of New York.                                                *
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
ORGFILTR CSECT ,
* ORGFILTR -
* This routine is a new addition to mailer as of version 1.20.
* It adds the capability to perform arbitrary processing of
* reader files based on the origin userid.  The main immediate
* use of this feature is to maintain a list of vmids not allowed
* to send mail (CMSBATCH machines for example).
*
* 1) Lookup MAILUSER in MAILOTAB.  If not found,  return RC=0
* 2) If found and RTPROG was specified,  call it and pass along
*    it's RC. Call sequence is  CALL PROG,(MAILBLOK,ROUTD).
* 3) If found and RTPROG was not specified,  "reject" the file
*    by writing a message and returning w/RC=4.
*
* Alan Crosswell,  2/85
*
*  CALLED VIA -
*  CALL ORGFILTR,(MAILBLOK)
         SPACE ,
PAB      DSECT ,
@MBLOK   DS    A             ADDRESS OF MAILBLOK
         SPACE ,
* REGISTER USAGE -
R0  EQU  0 -
R1  EQU  1 -
R2  EQU  2 -
R3  EQU  3 -
R4  EQU  4 -
R5  EQU  5 -
R6  EQU  6 -
R7  EQU  7 -
R8  EQU  8 -
R9  EQU  9 -
R10 EQU 10 -
R11 EQU 11 - MAILBLOK BASE
R12 EQU 12 - PROGRAM BASE
R13 EQU 13 - SAVE AREA
R14 EQU 14 - SUBROUTINE LINKAGE
R15 EQU 15 - SUBROUTINE LINKAGE
         SPACE
         PRINT NOGEN
         BLOCKS ,
         MAILBLOK ,
         EJECT
ORGFILTR CSECT ,
         USING ORGFILTR,R15  TEMPORARY ADDRESSABILITY
         B     EYESKIP       BRANCH OVER EYESKIP
MYNAME   DC    CL8'ORGFILTR',CL8'&SYSDATE'
EYESKIP  DS    0H
         DROP  R15
         STM   R14,R12,12(R13) SAVE CALLER'S REGS
         LR    R12,R15       PERMANENT ADDRESSABILITY
         USING ORGFILTR,R12
         LA    R14,SAVE      MY SAVE AREA
         ST    R13,4(R14)    SAVE CALLER'S PTR
         ST    R14,8(R13)    CHAIN MINE BACK
         LR    R13,R14       SET MY SAVE PTR
         USING PAB,R1        ADDRESS PARM
         L     R11,@MBLOK    GET MAILBLOK BASE
         DROP  R1
         USING MAILBLOK,R11  ADDRESSABILITY
         SPACE ,
         LA    R1,MAILUSER+7 point to end of userid
         LA    R4,8          max length of userid
TRIMLOOP EQU   *
         CLI   0(R1),C' '    trim trailing blanks
         BNE   TRIMOUT       done
         BCTR  R1,0          decrement data pointer
         BCT   R4,TRIMLOOP   decrement length and try again
TRIMOUT  EQU   *             here when have length in r4
         L     R5,MAILOTAB   point to Origins table
         LA    R3,MAILUSER   address of userid
         CALL  TBLUK,((R5),(R3),(R4),TWORK) look for userid
         LTR   R15,R15       find it?
         BNZ   NOTFOUND      no, just return then
         LR    R8,R1         get a handle on the routd
         USING ROUTD,R8      address it
         ICM   R15,B'1111',RTADDR address of exit routine
         BZ    REJECT        no exit implies simply reject.
         DROP  R8
         CALL  (15),((R11),(R8)) call user exit
RET      EQU   *
         L     R13,4(R13)              GET CALLER'S SAVE PTR
         L     R14,12(R13)             GET R14
         LM    R0,R12,20(R13)          GET R0-R12
         BR    R14                     RETURN
         SPACE ,
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
*  ERROR RETURNS
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTFOUND EQU   *             userid not in table
         SR    R15,R15       just return normally
         B     RET
         SPACE ,
REJECT   EQU   *             reject the file
         LA    R4,MAILUSER
         LA    R5,MAILFTXT
         WTR   ORG049,(CA,(R4),CA,(R5))
         LA    R15,4         set rc=4
         B     RET
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
*  READ-ONLY DATA
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
         LTORG ,
SAVE     DS    18F                     SAVE AREA
TWORK    DS    64F
         END   ORGFILTR
